---
import DocsLayout from "../layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
---

<DocsLayout
  title="Patterns"
  description="Reusable solutions for common page-level tasks. Patterns combine foundations and components into complete user flows."
  eyebrow="03 · Interface patterns"
>
  <div class="rule-callout">
    <span class="callout-icon" aria-hidden="true">i</span>
    <div>
      <strong>Patterns are proposals for review</strong>
      <p>They should remain flexible enough to serve different VINASIG products while keeping their core interaction clear.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="page-section" aria-labelledby="layout-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div><p class="section-kicker">Page structure</p><h2 id="layout-title">Stable navigation, focused content</h2></div>
      <p>Keep orientation predictable and let the main task lead each page.</p>
    </div>
    <article class="card">
      <div class="pattern-preview" role="img" aria-label="Illustration of a common website page layout">
        <div class="mock-page" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="mock-nav"><div class="mock-line mock-line-short mock-line-accent"></div><div class="mock-line"></div><div class="mock-line mock-line-short"></div><div class="mock-line"></div></div>
          <div class="mock-content"><div class="mock-title"></div><div class="mock-line"></div><div class="mock-line mock-line-short"></div><div class="mock-card-grid"><div class="mock-card"><div class="mock-dot"></div><div class="mock-line"></div></div><div class="mock-card"><div class="mock-dot"></div><div class="mock-line mock-line-short"></div></div></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <ul class="rule-list">
        <li><span class="rule-term">Orient</span><span class="rule-text">Keep the product or section identity and primary navigation in a consistent place.</span></li>
        <li><span class="rule-term">Focus</span><span class="rule-text">Give each page one clear title and group content around user tasks.</span></li>
        <li><span class="rule-term">Reflow</span><span class="rule-text">Let the page adapt to narrow screens without horizontal scrolling for ordinary content.</span></li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section" aria-labelledby="patterns-list-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div><p class="section-kicker">Common situations</p><h2 id="patterns-list-title">Patterns to document next</h2></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid">
      <article class="card"><h3>Forms</h3><p class="card-copy">Group related inputs, state requirements early, and help users fix errors without losing work.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><h3>Empty states</h3><p class="card-copy">Explain why content is missing and offer a useful next step when one is available.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><h3>Loading and errors</h3><p class="card-copy">Set expectations during longer work and offer a recovery action when something fails.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>
</DocsLayout>
